## Slide 4

Topics & Capabilities

Tasks
When was the last Labeler PM task completed on Line 1?
Inventory
Create a chart showing the materials and quantities located in shipping.
Materials
List materials and quantities one batch of Adravil 500 consumes?
Recall
There's been a recall on Vitamin A Show me orders I need to quarantine.
Orders
What do you suggest I prioritize to mitigate the impact of shortages?
Events
What are the top causes for downtime at my site?
Journals
Any recent concerning journal entries I should be aware of?
Production
What's the typical output quantity per day for my site?
Equipment & Areas
Can you provide a list of the Site, Area, System hierarchy for my Site?

Ask about everything* from “What was OEE yesterday?” to “Which machine is causing the most downtime?” 

