## Slide 9

Data Privacy & Security

Encrypted communication

Local Queries – no data lake necessary

Isolated per-customer AI instance in the Azure Cloud

Microsoft Azure compliance
Encrypted communication

Private, per-customer AI instance

No global data sharing or model training

Role-based permissions enforced
Threads are user specific.

